              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naiwe Mwana w'omuntu 'we, otabatiina, kandi otatiina ebigambo byabo, n'obu oraabe ori omu mikwatangwe n'omu mahwa, kandi otwire omuri skoropio. Otatiina ebigambo byabo, n'obu kwakuba okuhahaaza omutima ahabw'emireebekyere yaabo, ahakuba n'enju engomi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
